Certification a gold star
=========================

Version 1.4 of this package was accepted for publication in volume 3 (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2011/3-1/ ) of The Journal of Software for Algebra and
Geometry: Macaulay2 (see https://msp.org/jsag/ ) on 2011-05-20, in the article
Numerical Algebraic Geometry (see https://msp.org/jsag/2011/3-1/p02.xhtml )
(DOI: 10.2140/jsag.2011.3.5 (see https://doi.org/10.2140/jsag.2011.3.5 )). That
version can be obtained from the journal (see
https://msp.org/jsag/2011/3-1/jsag-v3-n1-x02-code.zip ).

