gateHomotopy(GateMatrix,GateMatrix,InputGate) -- homotopy implemented via straight line programs
************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note gateHomotopy:
    gateHomotopy_lpGateMatrix_cmGateMatrix_cmInputGate_rp,
  * Usage: 
        HS = gateHomotopy(H,X,T)
  * Inputs:
      * H, an instance of the type *note GateMatrix:
        (SLPexpressions)GateMatrix,, a family of systems (given by a column
        vector)
      * X, an instance of the type *note GateMatrix:
        (SLPexpressions)GateMatrix,, (a row vector of) variables
      * T, an instance of the type *note InputGate: (SLPexpressions)Gate,,
        homotopy (continuation) parameter
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Parameters: gateHomotopy_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmParameters=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
        => ..., default value null, specifies parameter names
      * *note Software: gateHomotopy_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSoftware=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null, specifies where evaluation should be done
        (M2=top level, M2engine=core)
      * *note Strategy: gateHomotopy_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value compress, strategy is either to "compress" or not
        (any other value)
  * Outputs:
      * HS
      * an instance of the type *note GateHomotopy:
        gateHomotopy_lpGateMatrix_cmGateMatrix_cmInputGate_rp, or an instance
        of the type *note GateParameterHomotopy: GateParameterHomotopy,, a
        homotopy that can be used with some routines of *note
        NumericalAlgebraicGeometry: Top,

Description
===========

Optional arguments:
  * *note Software: Software,-- specifies how the homotopy is evaluated:
    (M2,M2engine)
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = inputGate symbol X                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = X                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : InputGate                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Y = inputGate symbol Y                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Y                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : InputGate                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T = inputGate symbol T                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = T                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : InputGate                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : F = {X*X-1, Y*Y*Y-1}                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {((X * X) + -1), (((Y * Y) * Y) + -1)}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : G = {X*X+Y*Y-1, X*X*X+Y*Y*Y-1}                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {(((X * X) + (Y * Y)) + -1), ((((X * X) * X) + ((Y * Y) * Y)) + -1)}    |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : H = (1 - T) * F + T * G                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = {(((1 + (-1 * T)) * ((X * X) + -1)) + (T * (((X * X) + (Y * Y)) + -1))),|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (((1 + (-1 * T)) * (((Y * Y) * Y) + -1)) + (T * ((((X * X) * X) + ((Y * |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     Y) * Y)) + -1)))}                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : HS = gateHomotopy(transpose matrix {H},matrix{{X,Y}},T)                 |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = GateHomotopy{...11...}                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : GateHomotopy                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The order of inputs for unexported internal evaluation functions (evaluateH,
etc.) is fixed as follows: Parameters, X, T.

