|                                                                   |
|o2 : GateSystem                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : evaluate(F,point{{0.1,0.2+ii}})                               |
|                                                                   |
|o3 = | -.98+.1ii -2.959+.4ii |                                     |
|                                                                   |
|                1         2                                        |
|o3 : Matrix CC    <-- CC                                           |
