|                                                                             |
|o6 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Fab = gateSystem(matrix{params}, matrix{variables}, matrix{{a*x*y-1},{x^|
|                                                                             |
|o7 = gate system: 2 input(s) ---> 2 output(s) (with 2 parameters)            |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : GateSystem                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|3+y^2-b}})                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : evaluate(Fab,point{{1,2}},point{{0.1,0.2+ii}})                          |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = | -.98+.1ii -2.959+.4ii |                                               |
|                                                                             |
|                1         2                                                  |
