numericalIrreducibleDecomposition(Ideal) -- constructs a numerical variety defined by the given ideal
*****************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note numericalIrreducibleDecomposition:
    numericalIrreducibleDecomposition_lpIdeal_rp,
  * Usage: 
        V = numericalIrreducibleDecomposition I
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, contained in the ring of
        polynomials with complex coefficients
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Software: Software, => ..., default value null, specify internal
        or external software
