        for each set of the parameters

Description
===========

Solves a parametric polynomial system for several values of parameters.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = CC[u1,u2,u3,x,y]                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f1 = u1*(y-1)+u2*(y-2)+u3*(y-3)                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = u1*y + u2*y + u3*y - u1 - 2u2 - 3u3                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : f2 = (x-11)*(x-12)*(x-13)                                               |
|                                                                             |
|      3      2                                                               |
|o3 = x  - 36x  + 431x - 1716                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : try parameterHomotopy({f1,f2},{u1,u2,u3},{{1,0,0},{0,1+2*ii,0}},        |
|sh: 1: bertini: not found                                                    |
|true                                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = need to install Bertini to run these lines                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Software=>BERTINI) else "need to install Bertini to run these lines"         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

