parametricSegmentHomotopy -- creates an ansatz for a segment homotopy
*********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        PH = parametricSegmentHomotopy F
  * Inputs:
      * F, an instance of the type *note System: (NAGtypes)System,, either a
        *note GateSystem: GateSystem, or a *note PolySystem:
        (NAGtypes)PolySystem,
  * Outputs:
      * PH, an instance of the type *note GateParameterHomotopy:
        GateParameterHomotopy,,

Description
===========

This method returns a homotopy that after specialization of parameters is akin
to the output of *note segmentHomotopy: segmentHomotopy,. There are 2 m
parameters inPH where m is the number of parameters in F. The first m
parameters correspond to the starting point A in the parameter space. The last
m parameters correspond to the end point B in the parameter space.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : variables = declareVariable \ {x,y}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = {x, y}                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : params = declareVariable \ {a,b}                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {a, b}                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : F = gateSystem(matrix{params},                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = gate system: 2 input(s) ---> 2                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : GateSystem                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|matrix{variables}, matrix{{a*x*y-1},{x^3+y^2-b}})                            |
|                                                                             |
|output(s) (with 2 parameters)                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : PH = parametricSegmentHomotopy F;                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : parameters PH                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {{A , A , B , B }}                                                      |
|        a   b   a   b                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : GateMatrix                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : (a0,b0) = (1,2); startSolution = point{{1,1}};                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : (a1,b1) = (2,1);                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : H01 = specialize(PH, matrix{{a0,b0,a1,b1}});                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : targetSolution = first trackHomotopy(H01,{startSolution})              |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = targetSolution                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : Point                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : assert(norm evaluate(F,matrix{{a1,b1}},matrix targetSolution) < 0.0001)|
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use parametricSegmentHomotopy:
======================================

  * "parametricSegmentHomotopy(GateSystem)"
  * "parametricSegmentHomotopy(PolySystem)"

