segmentHomotopy -- a segment homotopy
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        H = segmentHomotopy(S,T)
  * Inputs:
      * S, an instance of the type *note System: (NAGtypes)System,, start
        system (could be GateSystem, PolySystem, or list of polynomials)
      * T, an instance of the type *note System: (NAGtypes)System,, target
        system  (could be GateSystem, PolySystem, or list of polynomials)
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note gamma: numerical homotopy tracking options, => ..., default value
        1, options for core functions of Numerical Algebraic Geometry
  * Outputs:
      * H, an instance of the type *note GateHomotopy:
        gateHomotopy_lpGateMatrix_cmGateMatrix_cmInputGate_rp,,

Description
===========

This method produces a *note Homotopy: Homotopy, (1-t) S+ t \gamma T,
t\in[0,1].

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T = {random(3,R)-1, random(2,R)-2}                                      |
|                                                                             |
|      9 3   9 2    3   2   7 3      7 2    7       7 2                       |
|o2 = {-x  + -x y + -x*y  + -y  - 1, -x  + --x*y + --y  - 2}                  |
|      2     4      4       4        9     10      10                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (S,solsS) = totalDegreeStartSystem T                                    |
|                                                                             |
|        3       2                                                            |
|o3 = ({x  - 1, y  - 1}, {{-.5-.866025*ii, -1}, {1, 1}, {1, -1},              |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {-.5+.866025*ii, 1}, {-.5+.866025*ii, -1}, {-.5-.866025*ii, 1}})        |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : H = segmentHomotopy(S,T,gamma=>1+ii)                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = GateHomotopy{...11...}                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : GateHomotopy                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : evaluateH(H,transpose matrix first solsS,0)                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = | -1.55431e-15ii |                                                      |
|     | -2.44929e-16ii |                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|                2         1                                                  |
|o5 : Matrix CC    <-- CC                                                     |
|              53        53                                                   |
