solveSystem(...,PostProcess=>...) -- specifies whether to postprocess the solutions
***********************************************************************************

Description
===========

Postprocessing includes refinement and clustering the solutions.

Caveat
======

Postprocessing is coded in top-level M2 language and can be much slower than
the homotopy continuation done without postprocessing.

