Optional parameters are:

  * ["block size"]:  (default = 1) How many rows of Jacobian are evaluated at
    each step when squaring up a system at a specified Point.
  * ["target rank"]:  (default = full rank) The target rank of the subsystem. 
  * [Field]:  (default = null). If null, then the coefficient ring is used for
    *note PolySystem: (NAGtypes)PolySystem, and CC is used for *note
    GateSystem: GateSystem,.
  * [Strategy]:  (default = "random matrix"). Given an overdetermined system, a
    random matrix is used to construct as many random linear combinations of
    the equations as there are variables. (Another option "slack variables" has
    not been implemented yet.)
  * [Verbose]:  (default = false).

